# Hero master footage. Hero V5.mp4 is 94MB and HeroV6.mp4 is 80MB — both past the
# size GitHub warns on and near the limit it refuses outright. What ships is what
# the encode produces: the frame sequence, the poster + LQIP, and the phone mp4.
# Keep the masters in the drive, not here.
#
# Both spellings are listed on purpose. V5 arrived as "Hero V5.mp4" and V6 as
# "HeroV6.mp4" — no space — so the original pattern silently stopped matching and
# an 80MB master was staged for commit. Add whichever spelling the next one uses.
Hero V*.mp4
HeroV*.mp4
hero-master*.mp4

